  "en": {
   "name": "The creek Radoljna",
   "subtitle": "",
   "description": "The Radoljna creek springs high in the woods of the Pohorje mountain. The fishing district Radoljna consists of the Radoljna creek from its spring to its outflow. The water is very clear , coming from the unspoilt nature and runs through almost idyllic environment.The district is salmonid and the creek is a typical mountain creek which provides home to mainly brown trouts. Fly fishing is allowed."
